is) the All-Mighty","p":"N","tr":"l-ʿazīzu","f":["MS","NOM"],"r":95,"l":110,"g":[["ٱلْ","DET","prefix","Al"],["عَزِيزُ","N","stem","MS|NOM"]]},{"i":"30:5:8","a":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","t":"the Most Merciful","p":"ADJ","tr":"l-raḥīmu","f":["MS","NOM"],"r":20,"l":101,"g":[["ٱل","DET","prefix","Al"],["رَّحِيمُ","ADJ","stem","MS|NOM"]]},{"e":"٥","v":"30:5"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"29:64","t":"And this worldly life is not but diversion and amusement. And indeed, the home of the Hereafter - that is the [eternal] life, if only they knew.","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"29:65","t":"And when they board a ship, they supplicate Allāh, sincere to Him in religion [i.e., faith and hope]. But when He delivers them to the land, at once they associate others with Him","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":65,"sd":null},{"k":"29:66","t":"So that they will deny what We have granted them, and they will enjoy themselves. But they are going to know.","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"29:67","t":"Have they not seen that We made [Makkah] a safe sanctuary, while people are being taken away all around them? Then in falsehood do they believe, and in the favor of Allāh they disbelieve?","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":67,"sd":null},{"k":"29:68","t":"And who is more unjust than one who invents a lie about Allāh or denies the truth when it has come to him? Is there not in Hell a [sufficient] residence for the disbelievers?","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":68,"sd":null},{"k":"29:69","t":"And those who strive for Us - We will surely guide them to Our ways. And indeed, Allāh is with the doers of good.","j":21,"h":41,"s":29,"a":69,"sd":null},{"k":"30:1","t":"Alif, Lām, Meem.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"30:2","t":"The Byzantines have been defeated","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"30:3","t":"In the nearest land. But they, after their defeat, will overcome","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"30:4","t":"Within three to nine years. To Allāh belongs the command [i.e., decree] before and after. And that day the believers will rejoice","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"30:5","t":"In the victory of Allāh. He gives victory to whom He wills, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.","j":21,"h":41,"s":30,"a":5,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":41,"surahs":[29,30],"sajdah":false}